      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. i also need to address the people who argue against it. i want to make sure i can quickly dismiss their concerns in my piece—most of them just seem to be stuck on old-school ideas about \"work ethic\" or they're just obsessed with how much it'll cost the government. can you give me a quick rundown of these common counter-arguments so i can show how they don't really hold up against the reality of the AI revolution?",
